-- הסכם קיבוצי מאושר — הפחתת שכר 2025-2026 (29.6.2025): the approved
-- collective agreement under the 2025 fiscal-stabilisation law. Who it
-- covers; the determining base; the 0.95% and 1.2% reductions and when
-- they run; the school-activities shift between December 2025 and January
-- 2026; the September 2025 seniority step; the one payslip line; what the
-- reductions do not touch; the school-role allowance postponed a year; the
-- 2025 clothing reduction; the integration and split allowances frozen; the
-- transfers to the union deferred; the extra substitution hour of תשפ"ו;
-- industrial peace; the follow-up committee; and the wages commissioner's
-- covering letter.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties

-- Time is counted in SALARY MONTHS: `month` y m is month m of year y, and a
-- salary "of" or "for" a month is that month's (convention
-- dates.salary-month), paid at the start of the next.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `month` y m IS
    y TIMES 12 PLUS m

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מאושר — הפחתת שכר 2025-2026`


-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The date of signing (the corpus marks its year as printed); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The first party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The second party, the teachers' union, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The second party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 A recital: the 2025 economic plan and the law it enacted, defined as "החוק".
-- akn:preamble/p8 A recital: the law reduces pay as an approved collective agreement provides.
-- akn:preamble/p9 A recital: without an approved agreement, the law's own reduction applies.
-- akn:preamble/p10 A recital: the law was amended on 19.5.2025 to extend the time to sign.
-- akn:preamble/p11 A recital: the parties reached the agreement to meet the saving the law defines.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1–5 הוראות כלליות`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
DECLARE `part of the agreement` IS ONE OF
    `the preamble`
    `the body of the agreement`
    `the covering letter`

-- §1 names the preamble and the annexes; the covering letter is the one
-- annex the agreement carries.
GIVEN p IS A `part of the agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `binds as the agreement` p IF
    TRUE

#ASSERT `binds as the agreement` `the preamble` AND `binds as the agreement` `the covering letter`

@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_3
DECLARE `form of a word` IS ONE OF masculine, feminine, singular, plural

GIVEN `written in` IS A `form of a word`, `read in` IS A `form of a word`, `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word written in one form reads in another` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited` IF
    (NOT `expressly limited`) OR `written in` EQUALS `read in`

#ASSERT `a word written in one form reads in another` singular plural FALSE

@ref akn:art_4
GIVEN `the instrument's standing` IS A NUMBER, `mentioned in this agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the standing of an administrative instrument` `the instrument's standing` `mentioned in this agreement` IS
    `the instrument's standing`

@ref akn:art_5
GIVEN `the reading without the headings` IS A STRING, `the reading the headings suggest` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the reading the agreement takes` `the reading without the headings` `the reading the headings suggest` IS
    `the reading without the headings`

§§ `6–7 תחולה`

@desc An employee, as far as §§6–7 ask who the agreement covers.
DECLARE `employee` HAS
    `in the civil service at the Ministry of Education` IS A BOOLEAN
    `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `in an institution as Ofek Hadash defines it, or an ulpan, on Ofek Hadash terms` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in a guidance role on Ofek Hadash terms`          IS A BOOLEAN @desc covered for the part of the position in guidance
    `in a college that trains teaching employees`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `in a supervision or headquarters role`            IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within §6` e IF
        e's `in the civil service at the Ministry of Education`
    AND e's `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`
    AND (   e's `in an institution as Ofek Hadash defines it, or an ulpan, on Ofek Hadash terms`
         OR e's `in a guidance role on Ofek Hadash terms`)

@ref akn:art_7
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by the agreement` e IF
        `within §6` e
    AND NOT e's `in a college that trains teaching employees`
    AND NOT (    e's `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`
             AND e's `in the civil service at the Ministry of Education`
             AND e's `in a supervision or headquarters role`)

§§ `8 הגדרות`

-- akn:art_8 The heading of the reductions part; the definitions follow.
-- akn:art_8/p1 The words that introduce the definitions; no rule.

@desc One component of what an employee is paid in a month.
DECLARE `salary component` HAS
    `amount`                                        IS A NUMBER
    `income from work`                              IS A BOOLEAN @desc income from work as §2(2) of the Income Tax Ordinance means it
    `paid in money`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `paid on a monthly, weekly or daily basis`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `computed on the basis of other salary components` IS A BOOLEAN
    `recuperation, clothing or a payment like them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whatever it is called
    `a reimbursement of expenses`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the employer's gross-up of the employee's tax` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_8__hc_4/p1
GIVEN c IS A `salary component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is salary` c IF
    c's `income from work` AND c's `paid in money`

@ref akn:art_8__hc_1/p1 akn:art_8__hc_1__para_a akn:art_8__hc_1__para_b akn:art_8__hc_1__para_c akn:art_8__hc_1__para_d
GIVEN c IS A `salary component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is in the determining base` c IF
        `is salary` c
    AND NOT (    NOT c's `paid on a monthly, weekly or daily basis`
             AND NOT c's `computed on the basis of other salary components`)
    AND NOT c's `recuperation, clothing or a payment like them`
    AND NOT c's `a reimbursement of expenses`
    AND NOT c's `the employer's gross-up of the employee's tax`

GIVEN cs IS A LIST OF `salary component`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the determining base` cs IS
    sum (map (GIVEN c YIELD c's `amount`) (filter `is in the determining base` cs))

-- akn:art_8__hc_2/p1 Defines "הסכם" for "על אף האמור בכל הסכם" (§9): every collective or personal arrangement, which `the reduction` overrides without asking which.
-- akn:art_8__hc_3/p1 Defines "הסכם קיבוצי" by the Collective Agreements Law; the agreement uses the words without a rule turning on them.
-- akn:art_8__hc_4/p2 Defines the pension fund and the training fund by the 2005 law; §§12 and 18 use them as named.

@desc The payments the agreement calls payments for school activities.
@ref akn:art_8__hc_5/p1
DECLARE `school-activities payment` HAS
    `for school or kindergarten activities as the 2008 and 2013 agreements define them, as amended on 19.10.2022` IS A BOOLEAN
    `amount paid` IS A NUMBER

§§ `9–13 הפחתות השכר`

-- §9: the rate by the salary month. Convention dates.salary-month: a
-- salary is the month it is for (F-ofek-hadash-wage-reduction-2025-a).
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9__para_a akn:art_9__para_b
GIVEN m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduction rate for the salary month` m IS
    IF m AT LEAST `month` 2025 5 AND m AT MOST `month` 2025 12 THEN 0.95%
    ELSE (IF m AT LEAST `month` 2026 1 AND m AT MOST `month` 2026 12 THEN 1.2% ELSE 0)

-- F-ofek-hadash-wage-reduction-2025-a: §9 puts a salary in a period if it is
-- paid IN the period "או בעדה", for it. The salary for December 2025 is paid
-- in January 2026, so the words put it in both periods, at both rates.
GIVEN `paid in` IS A NUMBER, `for` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the rates the words of §9 give a payment` `paid in` `for` IS
    filter (GIVEN r YIELD r GREATER THAN 0)
        (LIST (IF (`paid in` AT LEAST `month` 2025 5 AND `paid in` AT MOST `month` 2025 12)
                  OR (`for` AT LEAST `month` 2025 5 AND `for` AT MOST `month` 2025 12)
               THEN 0.95% ELSE 0),
              (IF (`paid in` AT LEAST `month` 2026 1 AND `paid in` AT MOST `month` 2026 12)
                  OR (`for` AT LEAST `month` 2026 1 AND `for` AT MOST `month` 2026 12)
               THEN 1.2% ELSE 0))

`the December 2025 salary falls in both periods of §9` MEANS
    `the rates the words of §9 give a payment` (`month` 2026 1) (`month` 2025 12) EQUALS LIST 0.95%, 1.2%
#ASSERT `the December 2025 salary falls in both periods of §9`

-- §10 is the same start, said by the payment: the salary for May 2025,
-- paid in June 2025, is the first reduced.
@ref akn:art_10
`the first salary month reduced` MEANS `month` 2025 5
#ASSERT `the reduction rate for the salary month` (`the first salary month reduced` MINUS 1) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the reduction rate for the salary month` `the first salary month reduced` EQUALS 0.95%

-- §11: an employee who starts after May 2025 is reduced from the start,
-- which the per-month rate already does: a month not worked has no salary.
@ref akn:art_11
GIVEN `first month worked` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the first month reduced for an employee starting in` `first month worked` IS
    max `first month worked` `the first salary month reduced`

@ref akn:art_9
GIVEN base IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduction` base m IS
    base TIMES `the reduction rate for the salary month` m

-- §12: the base of the training-fund contributions is reduced at the same rate.
@ref akn:art_12 akn:art_12/p2
GIVEN `training fund base` IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the training fund base after the reduction` `training fund base` m IS
    `training fund base` TIMES (1 MINUS `the reduction rate for the salary month` m)

-- §13: a payment in either period for a time before May 2025 is not reduced
-- under §9; for April 2025, §3 of the law reduces it instead. The law's
-- reduction is outside the corpus, so it is an input.
@ref akn:art_13
GIVEN `the reduction §3 of the law sets` IS A NUMBER, `paid in` IS A NUMBER, `for` IS A NUMBER, base IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduction of a payment` `the reduction §3 of the law sets` `paid in` `for` base IS
    IF `for` EQUALS `month` 2025 4 AND `paid in` AT LEAST `month` 2025 5
    THEN `the reduction §3 of the law sets`
    ELSE (IF `for` LESS THAN `month` 2025 4 THEN 0 ELSE `the reduction` base `for`)

#ASSERT `the reduction of a payment` 7 (`month` 2025 9) (`month` 2025 3) 10000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the reduction of a payment` 7 (`month` 2025 9) (`month` 2025 4) 10000 EQUALS 7

§§ `14 תשלום עבור פעילויות בית ספריות בדצמבר 2025`

-- §14 moves the school-activities payment of December 2025's salary out of
-- that month: December's reduction grows by it, January 2026's shrinks by
-- it. Convention amounts.deferred: what is moved, moves in full
-- (F-ofek-hadash-wage-reduction-2025-b).
@ref akn:art_14 akn:art_14__para_a akn:art_14__para_b akn:art_14__para_b/p2
GIVEN `the §9 reduction` IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, `December's school-activities payment` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduction after §14` `the §9 reduction` m `December's school-activities payment` IS
    IF m EQUALS `month` 2025 12 THEN `the §9 reduction` PLUS `December's school-activities payment`
    ELSE (IF m EQUALS `month` 2026 1
          THEN `the §9 reduction` MINUS `December's school-activities payment`
          ELSE `the §9 reduction`)

-- The agreement's own example: a payment of 200, reductions of 300 and 400.
@ref akn:art_14__para_b/p3 akn:art_14__para_b/p4 akn:art_14__para_b/p5 akn:art_14__para_b/p6 akn:art_14__para_b/p7 akn:art_14__para_b/p8 akn:art_14__para_b/p9 akn:art_14__para_b/p10 akn:art_14__para_b/p11 akn:art_14__para_b/p12 akn:art_14__para_b/p13
`the example's December reduction` MEANS `the reduction after §14` 300 (`month` 2025 12) 200
`the example's January reduction` MEANS `the reduction after §14` 400 (`month` 2026 1) 200
#ASSERT `the example's December reduction` EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `the example's January reduction` EQUALS 200
-- Over the two months the employee loses nothing beyond §9.
#ASSERT `the example's December reduction` PLUS `the example's January reduction` EQUALS 300 PLUS 400

-- F-ofek-hadash-wage-reduction-2025-b: §14(ב) does not say what happens when
-- December's payment is larger than January's reduction. A part-time
-- teacher whose January reduction is 150 and whose December payment was 200
-- has a January "reduction" of −50.
`a January reduction smaller than December's payment goes below zero` MEANS
    `the reduction after §14` 150 (`month` 2026 1) 200 LESS THAN 0
#ASSERT `a January reduction smaller than December's payment goes below zero`

§§ `15–16 ותק בהוראה בספטמבר–דצמבר 2025`

-- akn:art_15 The heading of §§15–16; the rules follow.
@ref akn:art_15/p1
`this agreement changes how seniority is recognised for advancing on the salary table` MEANS FALSE

-- §16: a seniority step in September 2025's salary is taken back, month by
-- month, in the salaries of September to December 2025 inclusive.
@ref akn:art_16
GIVEN `the rise the step gives` IS A NUMBER, `stepped in September 2025` IS A BOOLEAN, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the seniority-step reduction` `the rise the step gives` `stepped in September 2025` m IS
    IF `stepped in September 2025` AND m AT LEAST `month` 2025 9 AND m AT MOST `month` 2025 12
    THEN `the rise the step gives`
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the seniority-step reduction` 120 TRUE (`month` 2025 12) EQUALS 120
#ASSERT `the seniority-step reduction` 120 TRUE (`month` 2026 1) EQUALS 0

§§ `17 שורה אחת בתלוש`

DECLARE `payslip action` IS ONE OF
    `show the reductions in one line` HAS `line title` IS A STRING

@ref akn:art_17
GIVEN `total of §§9–16` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `payslip action`
DECIDE `the payslip line` `total of §§9–16` IS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `show the reductions in one line` `line title`
          PROVIDED `line title` EQUALS "חוק הת. כלכלית אופק"
    WITHIN 1
    LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "§17: the reductions appear in one payslip line, titled חוק הת. כלכלית אופק"

#TRACE `the payslip line` 100 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the State` DOES `show the reductions in one line` "חוק הת. כלכלית אופק" AT 0

§§ `18 סייג לעניין תשלומים שונים`

-- akn:art_18 The heading of §18; the rule follows.
@ref akn:art_18/p1 akn:art_18__para_1 akn:art_18__para_2 akn:art_18__para_3 akn:art_18__para_4 akn:art_18__para_5
DECLARE `protected matter` IS ONE OF
    `a one-off payment on leaving work`
    `the contribution to a pension fund`
    `the determining salary of a budgetary pension`
    `budgetary pension payments`
    `bridging payments or an employer-funded pension addition`

-- Every protected matter is computed as though the reductions had not been made.
GIVEN matter IS A `protected matter`, `the amount without the reductions` IS A NUMBER, `the amount with them` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the amount of a protected matter` matter `the amount without the reductions` `the amount with them` IS
    `the amount without the reductions`

-- akn:art_18__para_5/p2 The heading of §19 (the school-role allowance, §22 of the agreement of 19.10.2022), printed in the corpus under §18(5); the rule is §19's.

§§ `19 גמול תפקיד בית ספרי`

-- §19 substitutes the year §22.1 of the agreement of 19.10.2022 starts the
-- school-role allowance from: the school year beginning 1.9.2026 (תשפ"ז)
-- in place of the one beginning 1.9.2025 (תשפ"ו). A school year is named
-- by the calendar year it begins in.
@ref akn:art_19
`the year §22.1 started the school-role allowance before §19` MEANS 2025
`the year §22.1 starts the school-role allowance` MEANS 2026

GIVEN `school year beginning` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school-role allowance runs in` `school year beginning` IF
    `school year beginning` AT LEAST `the year §22.1 starts the school-role allowance`

#ASSERT NOT `the school-role allowance runs in` 2025
#ASSERT `the school-role allowance runs in` 2026

§§ `20 קצובת ביגוד לשנת 2025`

@desc The figures §20 computes the 2025 clothing reduction from.
DECLARE `clothing reduction year` HAS
    `the תשפ"ה clothing allowance with indexation`    IS A NUMBER @desc for a full position and the whole year; an input
    `the תשפ"ה clothing allowance without indexation` IS A NUMBER @desc for a full position and the whole year; an input
    `position share`                                  IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position the clothing allowance is paid by
    `share of the year`                               IS A NUMBER @desc the share of the תשפ"ה school year the clothing allowance is paid by

@ref akn:art_20 akn:art_20/p1 akn:art_20__para_a akn:art_20__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_20__para_a__subpara_1__cls_a akn:art_20__para_a__subpara_1__cls_b
GIVEN y IS A `clothing reduction year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position clothing reduction` y IS
    (y's `the תשפ"ה clothing allowance with indexation` MINUS y's `the תשפ"ה clothing allowance without indexation`)
    PLUS 91

-- §20(א)(2): "בהתאם לחלקיות המשרה או לתקופת עבודתו". Convention
-- position.two-measures: both measures apply, as they do to the clothing
-- allowance itself (F-ofek-hadash-wage-reduction-2025-c).
@ref akn:art_20__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_20__para_a__subpara_2/p2
GIVEN y IS A `clothing reduction year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2025 clothing reduction` y IS
    `the full-position clothing reduction` y TIMES min (y's `position share`) 1 TIMES min (y's `share of the year`) 1

`a half position for half the year` MEANS
    `clothing reduction year` WITH
        `the תשפ"ה clothing allowance with indexation`    IS 1100
        `the תשפ"ה clothing allowance without indexation` IS 1000
        `position share`                                  IS 0.5
        `share of the year`                               IS 0.5

-- F-ofek-hadash-wage-reduction-2025-c: read with "or" as either one measure,
-- the half-position, half-year teacher is reduced by half, not a quarter.
`"or" read as one measure reduces a part-time, part-year teacher twice as much` MEANS
    NOT (`the 2025 clothing reduction` `a half position for half the year`
         EQUALS `the full-position clothing reduction` `a half position for half the year` TIMES 0.5)
#ASSERT `"or" read as one measure reduces a part-time, part-year teacher twice as much`
#ASSERT `the 2025 clothing reduction` `a half position for half the year` EQUALS (100 PLUS 91) TIMES 0.25

-- §20(ב): from תשפ"ו on, the clothing allowance includes the תשפ"ה update.
@ref akn:art_20__para_b
GIVEN `school year beginning` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2025 clothing reduction applies to the clothing allowance of` `school year beginning` IF
    `school year beginning` EQUALS 2024

#ASSERT NOT `the 2025 clothing reduction applies to the clothing allowance of` 2025

-- §20(ג): §18 protects the same matters from the clothing reduction, by the
-- same rule (`the amount of a protected matter`).
@ref akn:art_20__para_c
`§18 applies to the 2025 clothing reduction` MEANS TRUE

-- §20(ד): the clothing reduction joins §17's line.
@ref akn:art_20__para_d
GIVEN `total of §§9–16` IS A NUMBER, `the clothing reduction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the payslip line's amount` `total of §§9–16` `the clothing reduction` IS
    `total of §§9–16` PLUS `the clothing reduction`

§§ `21 גמולי שילוב ופיצול בשנת 2026`

-- §21: §§24 and 25 of the agreement of 19.10.2022 (the integration and
-- split allowances), and §§8 and 14 of the follow-up committee's decision of
-- 23.4.2025, do not apply in תשפ"ו or in September–December 2026.
@ref akn:art_21 akn:art_21/p1 akn:art_21__para_a
GIVEN m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the integration and split allowances are frozen in` m IF
    m AT LEAST `month` 2025 9 AND m AT MOST `month` 2026 12

#ASSERT `the integration and split allowances are frozen in` (`month` 2026 10)
#ASSERT NOT `the integration and split allowances are frozen in` (`month` 2027 1)

-- akn:art_21__para_b Replaces the wording of §15 of the follow-up committee's decision of 23.4.2025 (outside the corpus): the cost frame of the commissioner's letter of 19.10.2022 applies pro rata from 1.1.2027, and the rules of §§8 and 14 apply until the parties set others.

DECLARE `negotiation action` IS ONE OF
    `negotiate an alternative budget source`
    `anchor what is agreed in a follow-up committee decision`

@ref akn:art_21__para_c akn:art_21__para_c/p2 akn:art_21__para_c/p3
`the negotiation in תשפ"ו` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `negotiate an alternative budget source`
    WITHIN 12
    HENCE PARTY `the State`
          MAY `anchor what is agreed in a follow-up committee decision`

§§ `22–23 דחיית תשלומים להסתדרות המורים`

-- Amounts in millions of shekels.
@ref akn:art_22 akn:art_22/p1
`the 2025 allocation deferred to 2026` MEANS 20

@ref akn:art_23 akn:art_23__para_a akn:art_23__para_b akn:art_23__para_c
`the transfers deferred to 2026` MEANS LIST 14.281, 9.571, 21.148
`the gifts and culture items` MEANS LIST 12.113, 0.494, 1.014, 0.207, 0.237, 0.216

-- The agreement's figures add up: the three transfers are the 45 million
-- it names, and the six items of (א) are its 14.281 million.
#ASSERT sum `the transfers deferred to 2026` EQUALS 45
#ASSERT sum `the gifts and culture items` EQUALS 14.281

-- akn:art_23__para_c/p2 The heading of §§24–26 (an extra frontal hour in תשפ"ו, for the 4.5.2025 action), printed in the corpus under §23(ג); the rules are theirs.

§§ `24–26 שעת מילוי מקום נוספת בתשפ"ו`

DECLARE `substitution action` IS ONE OF
    `teach one frontal substitution hour beyond the position`
    `pay for the hour` HAS `amount paid for the hour` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_24
GIVEN `worked regularly on 4.5.2025` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `owes the extra substitution hour` `worked regularly on 4.5.2025` IF
    NOT `worked regularly on 4.5.2025`

-- §25: 25% of the employee's hour value, and nothing more for that hour.
@ref akn:art_25
GIVEN `hour value` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pay for the extra hour` `hour value` IS
    `hour value` TIMES 25%

-- akn:art_25/p2 The corpus's own note that the page prints 25%, not 125%; no rule.

-- §26: a teacher who worked by the fixed timetable on 4.5.2025 (a free day
-- by it, a school trip) owes no hour under §24.
@ref akn:art_26
`the extra hour in תשפ"ו` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `teach one frontal substitution hour beyond the position`
    WITHIN 12
    HENCE PARTY `the State`
          MUST `pay for the hour` `amount paid for the hour`
               PROVIDED `amount paid for the hour` AT LEAST `the pay for the extra hour` 100
          WITHIN 1

#ASSERT `owes the extra substitution hour` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `owes the extra substitution hour` TRUE
#ASSERT `the pay for the extra hour` 100 EQUALS 25

§§ `27–30 שקט תעשייתי, סכסוך, ועדת מעקב`

-- akn:art_27 The heading of §§27–28; the rules follow.
@ref akn:art_27/p1 akn:art_28
`the union's claims about signing an approved agreement are exhausted` MEANS TRUE
`this agreement takes away from the industrial-peace provisions already binding` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:art_29 The heading of §29; the rule follows.
@ref akn:art_29/p1
`the labour dispute of 10.4.2025 stands` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:art_30 The heading of §30; the rule follows.
@ref akn:art_30/p1
DECLARE `committee action` IS ONE OF
    `decide a dispute about this agreement`

GIVEN `the committee's decision` IS A STRING, `a party's reading` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `what binds the parties in a dispute` `the committee's decision` `a party's reading` IS
    `the committee's decision`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 Signing for the government; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p4 Signing for the union; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p5 The Director-General's stamp; no rule.

§§ `מכתב הממונה על השכר`

-- akn:attachments The annexes: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 The corpus's label for the covering letter; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 The addressee line; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 The addressee's name; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 The addressee's post; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 The subject line (the corpus marks its year as printed); no rule.

DECLARE `letter action` IS ONE OF
    `inform the union of the lower rate, with its details`
    `negotiate amending the rate, with alternative sources`

-- ¶1: if the law sets a lower rate for teachers the agreement does not
-- cover, the State tells the union within 14 days, with the details.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2
GIVEN `the other group's rate` IS A NUMBER, `the §9 rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `letter action`
DECIDE `the State's duty if another group's rate is lower` `the other group's rate` `the §9 rate` IS
    IF `the other group's rate` LESS THAN `the §9 rate`
    THEN PARTY `the State`
         MUST  `inform the union of the lower rate, with its details`
         WITHIN 14
         HENCE PARTY `the State`
               MUST `negotiate amending the rate, with alternative sources`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- ¶3: if an amendment of the law lowers the saving below the agreement's, the
-- reduction is lowered so the saving matches what §3 of the law as amended
-- would give; ¶4: never below what that would give, and subject to the law.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4
GIVEN `the saving the agreement gives` IS A NUMBER, `the saving the amended law would give` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the saving the reduction is adjusted to` `the saving the agreement gives` `the saving the amended law would give` IS
    min `the saving the agreement gives` `the saving the amended law would give`

#ASSERT `the saving the reduction is adjusted to` 100 80 EQUALS 80
#ASSERT `the saving the reduction is adjusted to` 100 120 EQUALS 100

-- akn:attachments/p1 The letter's closing; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p2 The signature; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p3 The signatory's name; no rule.
